      "hardware_label": "1x RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96GB",
      "notes": "Concurrency=16 aggregate throughput, sweet-spot config. 16 parallel chat completions, 8 distinct prompts cycled with per-request seeding to defeat prefix caching, temp=0.7, max_tokens=600 (avg actual=564). Wall 8.62s, total 9,029 tokens, no queueing (max-num-seqs=16), p95 ≈ p50, 0 KV preemptions. Continuous batching only — Eagle3 spec-decode tested and dropped (27% accept on NVFP4 target → -29% throughput). Per-stream ~69 t/s under load vs 128 t/s single-stream. KV cache FP8. EPYC 32c/64t host, 160 GB DDR5. Run 2026-05-09.",
